<concept id="d13aAjan855" xml:lang="en">
   <title>Doc Fields</title>
   <prolog>
      <author>Maanasa Suthrave</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Aug 13, 2019"/>
      </critdates>
      <metadata>
         <prodinfo>
            <prodname>X-Author Contracts for Cloud on Salesforce Summer 2019 User Guide</prodname>
         </prodinfo>
      </metadata>
   </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>The <b>Fields</b> section of the Document Panel lists all smart fields in the agreement document. Use the Document Panel to take the following actions on fields in the document:</p>
      <ul>
         <li>
            <xref href="to_view_and_change_fields.dita#DocFields_viewchange">View and change field values in the document</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="marking_fields.dita#DocFields_MarkFields">Mark Fields</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="rejecting_changes_to_a_field.dita#DocFields_RejectChanges">Reject changed field values</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="validating_fields.dita#DocFields_validatefields">Validate field value format</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="marking_fields_for_deletion.dita#DocFields_deletefields">Mark fields for deletion</xref>
         </li>
      </ul>
   </conbody>
</concept>